Your large cat is no more than level 9.  It will only attack monsters
level 10 or below unless you are causing conflict.  Monsters only
attack your pet if your pet attacks them (or if they miss you because
you are invisible or displaced and accidentally hit your pet).  Your
cat will attack soldiers, and possibly captains.  Due to the sheer
number of those in the castle, your cat would most likely die.  I
suggest polymorphing the cat into something meaner, or leaving it on
the level above the castle, then coming back for it once the castle is
safely vacated.

